Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,And then the last thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:02.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think makes sense
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:03.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,I see a lot of people do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:04.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,now, is, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:05.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think it used to be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:06.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,that you could just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.46,0:00:07.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,build some software
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:07.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,put it out there and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:08.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,people would use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:09.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:10.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:10.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,if you can actually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:11.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,solve people's problems
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:13.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,right, that's way more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:13.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:14.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,So can you be like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:15.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,forward-deployed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:15.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,engineer that just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:16.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,solves problems for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:17.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,people? Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:18.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think that ends up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,actually being a way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,that I see a lot of YC
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:21.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,companies now get the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:22.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,first couple of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,customers.
